ction, model migration, and prompt-upgrade work."},"path":"C:\\Users\\Admin\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\d8b3f94b-3b8e-4216-9e76-f2658b2a6d63\\a8da0bcf-f9b3-47d2-ba6a-ab43b72033ca\\skills\\.system\\openai-docs\\SKILL.md","scope":"system","enabled":true},{"name":"plugin-creator","description":"Create and scaffold plugin directories for Codex with a required `.codex-plugin/plugin.json`, optional plugin folders/files, valid manifest defaults, and personal-marketplace entries by default. Use when Codex needs to create a new personal plugin, add optional plugin structure, generate or update marketplace entries for plugin ordering and availability metadata, or update an existing local plugin during development with the CLI-driven cachebuster and reinstall flow.","interface":{"displayName":"Plugin Creator","shortDescription":"Scaffold plugins and marketplace entries","iconSmall":"C:\\Users\\Admin\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\d8b3f94b-3b8e-4216-9e76-f2658b2a6d63\\a8da0bcf-f9b3-47d2-ba6a-ab43b72033ca\\skills\\.system\\plugin-creator\\assets\\plugin-creator-small.svg","iconLarge":"C:\\Users\\Admin\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\d8b3f94b-3b8e-4216-9e76-f2658b2a6d63\\a8da0bcf-f9b3-47d2-ba6a-ab43b72033ca\\skills\\.system\\plugin-creator\\assets\\plugin-creator.png","iconSmallUrl":null,"iconLargeUrl":null,"brandColor":null,"defaultPrompt":"Use $plugin-creator to scaffold a valid plugin in the personal marketplace, then validate it before handing it back."},"path":"C:\\Users\\Admin\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\d8b3f94b-3b8e-4216-9e76-f2658b2a6d63\\a8da0bcf-f9b3-47d2-ba6a-ab43b72033ca\\skills\\.system\\plugin-creator\\SKILL.md","scope":"system","enabled":true},{"name":"review-agent","description":"Perform a read-only, defect-first review of a specified code change and return every actionable finding. Use when another agent delegates review of uncommitted changes, a base-branch diff, a commit, or custom review instructions.","interface":{"displayName":"Review Agent","shortDescription":"Find actionable bugs in code changes","iconSmall":null,"iconLarge":null,"iconSmallUrl":null,"iconLargeUrl":null,"brandColor":null,"defaultPrompt":"Use $review-agent to review the requested code changes and return actionable findings."},"path":"C:\\Users\\Admin\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\d8b3f94b-3b8e-4216-9e76-f2658b2a6d63\\a8da0bcf-f9b3-47d2-ba6a-ab43b72033ca\\skills\\.system\\review-agent\\SKILL.md","scope":"system","enabled":true},{"name":"skill-creator","description":"Guide for creating effective skills. This skill should be used when users want to create a new skill (or update an existing skill) that extends Codex's capabilities with specialized knowledge, workflows, or tool integrations.","shortDescription":"Create or update a skill","interface":{"displayName":"Skill Creator","shortDescription":"Create or update a skill","iconSmall":"C:\\Users\\Admin\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\d8b3f94b-3b8e-4216-9e76-f2658b2a6d63\\a8da0bcf-f9b3-47d2-ba6a-ab43b72033ca\\skills\\.system\\skill-creator\\assets\\skill-creator-small.svg","iconLarge":"C:\\Users\\Admin\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\d8b3f94b-3b8e-4216-9e76-f2658b2a6d63\\a8da0bcf-f9b3-47d2-ba6a-ab43b72033ca\\skills\\.system\\skill-creator\\assets\\skill-creator.png","iconSmallUrl":null,"iconLargeUrl":null,"brandColor":null,"defaultPrompt":null},"path":"C:\\Users\\Admin\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\d8b3f94b-3b8e-4216-9e76-f2658b2a6d63\\a8da0bcf-f9b3-47d2-ba6a-ab43b72033ca\\skills\\.system\\skill-creator\\SKILL.md","scope":"system","enabled":true},{"name":"skill-installer","description":"Install Codex skills into $CODEX_HOME/skills from a curated list or a GitHub repo path. Use when a user asks to list installable skills, install a curated skill, or install a skill from another repo (including private repos).","shortDescription":"Install curated skills from openai/skills or other repos","interface":{"displayName":"Skill Installer","shortDescription":"Install curated skills from openai/skills or other repos","iconSmall":"C:\\Users\\Admin\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\d8b3